  "boundary": "Original MenuModelAdapter::BuildMenu supplies the live ui::MenuModel for either MenuRunner constructor. Original MenuWillShow, MenuWillClose, ActivatedAt and OnMenuClosed remain in Chromium. Existing NSMenu projection is reused.",
